WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.441 --> 00:00:03.075
Lesson eleven. My Body!

2
00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:11.060
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.048 --> 00:00:13.946
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.996 --> 00:00:17.137
Today we learn: My Body! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.594 --> 00:00:21.927
Head! Say it with me. Head!

6
00:00:25.863 --> 00:00:29.529
Shoulders! Say it with me. Shoulders!

7
00:00:33.591 --> 00:00:37.241
Knees! Say it with me. Knees!

8
00:00:41.455 --> 00:00:45.539
Toes! Say it with me. Toes!

9
00:00:49.519 --> 00:00:53.452
Hands! Say it with me. Hands!

10
00:00:57.211 --> 00:01:00.377
Feet! Say it with me. Feet!

11
00:01:04.445 --> 00:01:08.311
Eyes! Say it with me. Eyes!

12
00:01:12.313 --> 00:01:16.146
Ears! Say it with me. Ears!

13
00:01:20.129 --> 00:01:26.277
Listen. Touch your head. Touch your toes.

14
00:01:26.327 --> 00:01:30.816
Say it with me. Touch your head. Touch your toes.

15
00:01:35.593 --> 00:01:41.892
Touch your head, shoulders, knees, and toes! Now clap your hands and stomp your feet.

16
00:01:41.942 --> 00:01:43.267
I like this story!

17
00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:48.345
Touch your knees!

18
00:01:48.395 --> 00:01:50.535
Knees! Well done!

19
00:01:51.825 --> 00:01:56.159
Touch your feet!

20
00:01:56.209 --> 00:01:58.283
Feet! Well done!

21
00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:04.046
This is U. U is for umbrella. U is for up.

22
00:02:08.062 --> 00:02:15.237
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

23
00:02:15.287 --> 00:02:16.883
Bye-bye, friends!

